The optional UR5 demonstration downloads robot descriptions and meshes from
Gepetto/example-robot-data, with upstream attribution to ROS-Industrial's
universal_robot/ur_description. These external assets retain their original
licenses and notices. The asset loader preserves supplied license and
attribution documents in compiled visual bundles.

